<p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Geist Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Menlo, Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6386;">Next retry</p>
